Hits the target with your weapon doing [135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180% (TL1-5)] damage, and with a shield strike doing [135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180% (TL1-5)] damage. If the shield strike connects, your shield will explode in a burst of light that inflicts [184, 248, 298, 340, 377 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage on all targets except yourself within radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] of the target, and light up all tiles in that radius.

The light damage will increase with your Spellpower.
